<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Inventaire_Signalé_{{ "now"|date("Ymd_His") }}</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            margin: 2cm;
            @bottom-right {
                content: "Page " counter(page) " sur " counter(pages);
            }
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
            color: #2d3436;
            line-height: 1.4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background: #fff;
        }
        .no-print {
            padding: 20px;
            background: #f1f2f6;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe4ea;
            text-align: center;
        }
        @media print {
            .no-print { display: none; }
        }
        .doc-header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }
        .institution-name {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .doc-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        .meta-info {
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        .main-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .main-table th {
            background-color: #f1f2f6;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .main-table td {
            border: 1px solid #b2bec3;
            padding: 6px 8px;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        .text-right { text-align: right; }
        .text-center { text-align: center; }
        .alert-row { background-color: #fff9db !important; }
        .alert-text { color: #d63031; font-weight: bold; }
        
        .summary-section {
            margin-top: 20px;
            width: 40%;
            margin-left: auto;
        }
        .summary-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        .summary-table td {
            padding: 5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dfe4ea;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .signature-area {
            margin-top: 80px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .sig-box {
            width: 200px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .sig-line {
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding-top: 5px;
        }
        .watermark {
            position: fixed;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-45deg);
            font-size: 80px;
            color: rgba(0,0,0,0.03);
            z-index: -1;
            white-space: nowrap;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="watermark">CONFIDENTIEL HOSPISMART</div>

    <div class="no-print">
        <button onclick="window.print()" style="padding: 10px 20px; cursor: pointer; background: #6366f1; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 5px;">
            Imprimer le Rapport Officiel
        </button>
        <a href="{{ path('app_medicament_index') }}" style="margin-left: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: #64748b;">Retour au tableau de bord</a>
    </div>

    <div style="padding: 0.5cm;">
        <div class="doc-header">
            <div>
                <div class="institution-name">HospiSmart</div>
                <div style="font-size: 10px;">Système de Gestion Pharmaceutique Avancé</div>
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 10px; text-align: right;">
                Réf: INV-{{ "now"|date("Ymd") }}-{{ medicaments|length }}<br>
                Généré le: {{ exportDate|date('d F Y à H:i') }}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="doc-title">Rapport d'État des Stocks de Médicaments</div>

        <table class="meta-info">
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 50%;"><strong>Responsable :</strong> Pharmacien de garde</td>
                <td style="text-align: right;"><strong>Période :</strong> {{ "now"|date("F Y") }}</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <table class="main-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 40px;">REF</th>
                    <th>DESIGNATION</th>
                    <th class="text-center" style="width: 60px;">QTE</th>
                    <th class="text-right" style="width: 80px;">P.U (€)</th>
                    <th class="text-right" style="width: 90px;">TOTAL (€)</th>
                    <th class="text-center" style="width: 100px;">EXPIRATION</th>
                    <th class="text-center" style="width: 80px;">STATUT</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {% set totalValue = 0 %}
                {% set alertCount = 0 %}
                {% for medicament in medicaments %}
                    {% set itemValue = medicament.quantite * medicament.prixUnitaire %}
                    {% set totalValue = totalValue + itemValue %}
                    {% if medicament.quantite <= medicament.seuilAlerte %}
                        {% set alertCount = alertCount + 1 %}
                    {% endif %}
                    <tr class="{{ medicament.quantite <= medicament.seuilAlerte ? 'alert-row' : '' }}">
                        <td class="text-center">#{{ medicament.id }}</td>
                        <td><strong>{{ medicament.nom|upper }}</strong></td>
                        <td class="text-center">{{ medicament.quantite }}</td>
                        <td class="text-right">{{ medicament.prixUnitaire|number_format(2, '.', ' ') }}</td>
                        <td class="text-right">{{ itemValue|number_format(2, '.', ' ') }}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">{{ medicament.datePeremption|date('d/m/Y') }}</td>
                        <td class="text-center">
                            {% if medicament.quantite <= medicament.seuilAlerte %}
                                <span class="alert-text">RÉAPPRO.</span>
                            {% else %}
                                <span>CONFORME</span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
            <div style="font-size: 10px; width: 50%;">
                <p><strong>Note :</strong> Ce document récapitule l'état théorique des stocks à l'instant T. <br>
                Toute anomalie doit être signalée immédiatement à la direction logistique.</p>
                <p>Alertes identifiées : <strong>{{ alertCount }}</strong></p>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-section">
                <table class="summary-table">
                    <tr>
                        <td>Nombre de références</td>
                        <td class="text-right"><strong>{{ medicaments|length }}</strong></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Valeur totale du stock</td>
                        <td class="text-right" style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #1e3799;">
                            {{ totalValue|number_format(2, '.', ' ') }} €
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="signature-area">
            <div class="sig-box">
                Fait à ...................................<br>
                Le {{ "now"|date("d/m/Y") }}
            </div>
            <div class="sig-box">
                Signature du Responsable
                <div class="sig-line">Cachet de l'établissement</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>

